lid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">19.8%</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">48.7%</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:left\">Debt / Equity</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">0.68x</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">0.64x</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #B9B2A5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">1.67x</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;color:#7B8491\">Source: restated financial information in the DRHP; EBITDA and ratios computed from it.</p><p style=\"margin:24px 0 8px 0;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A07A35;\">How we would like to participate</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 8px 0\"><tr><td width=\"34\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-top:1px\"><div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;line-height:20px;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px solid #A07A35;color:#A07A35;text-align:center;font-family:'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700\">1</div></td><td style=\"font-fami